    "detailed_description": "<strong>\u203bThis game is currently under development. Since it has not been completed, various functions will be added or updated in the future.</strong><br><br>What if things move in your workplace?<br>You are a part-time employee working at the counter. <br>Do not let live toys go out.<br><br><br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br>\u25c6 Game description<br>    \u2192 This game is a VR-only game and you need a Vive or Oculus Headset.<br><br>\u25b6 At the counter, the game starts at the part-time employee and can not be moved.<br>    Use your toy guns and objects to stop them from getting out.<br><br>\u25b6 Throw or shoot 4 firearms and 10 or more items to stop the toys.<br><br>\u25b6 The stage consists of three in total, the boss appeared in the last stage!<br><br>\u25b6 It is not disturbing because it does not move. Children can do it easily.<br><br>\u25b6 Achieve a high score and achieve your rank!",
